From: root <root@e2b.local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:46:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fcm): icon maalum + color ya brand kwenye push
 notifications
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Push za FCM sasa zinatumia ic_notification (drawable nyeupe ya app) +
color #1E40AF — status bar na heads-up zinaonyesha icon sahihi ya
Kubadilishana badala ya duara jeupe.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
---
 app/services/fcm.py | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/services/fcm.py b/app/services/fcm.py
index 05acea8..927d458 100644
--- a/app/services/fcm.py
+++ b/app/services/fcm.py
@@ -122,7 +122,10 @@ async def send_push_to_user(
             image=image,
         )
 
-        # Android config — channel kulingana na aina ya event
+        # Android config — channel kulingana na aina ya event.
+        # icon: drawable nyeupe maalum ya app (ic_notification) — bila hii
+        # Android inaonyesha duara jeupe kwenye status bar/heads-up.
+        # color: accent ya brand kwenye icon na heads-up.
         channel = _channel_for(data)
         android_config = messaging.AndroidConfig(
             priority="high",
@@ -132,6 +135,8 @@ async def send_push_to_user(
                 image=image,
                 click_action="FLUTTER_NOTIFICATION_CLICK",
                 channel_id=channel,
+                icon="ic_notification",
+                color="#1E40AF",
             ),
         )
 
